    "No direct absolute bioavailability measurement for the query molecule.",
    "Fasted-state solubility and dissolution data for the query are unavailable.",
    "No human PK data for the exact query; extrapolation relies on close analogues."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [],
  "revision_action": "initial"
}

